<title>UK: LIFFE coffee surges 7.7 pct, cocoa mixed PM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee surges 7.7 pct, cocoa mixed PM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Nearbys rise sharply on buy-stops with Sept rising by 7.7 pct to $1,917 a tonne, up $139, at 1443 GMT. No news seen.</p>
<p>COCOA - Turns mixed after nearby positions give up early gains and head lower. Sept down eight at 1,115 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Down but off-lows in slow trading. Aug off 10 cents at $323.50.</p>
</text>
